              answer:
                'The "Quarterly Business Report - Q4 2025" Key Metrics indicate the following:\n\n- Active users: 45 million, with a growth rate of 22%.\n- Monthly recurring revenue: $350 million.\n- Net Promoter Score (NPS) improved from 62 previously to 71 currently, reflecting increased customer loyalty and satisfaction.\n- Employee headcount: 8,500.\n- Number of offices: 12.\n- Research and development (R&D) investment: $840 million, which is 20% of revenue.\n\nNo additional detailed information about these specific metrics or the company is available in the provided sources. The data aligns with typical key performance indicators tracked in quarterly business reports, such as user growth, revenue, customer satisfaction (NPS), workforce size, office footprint, and R&D spending as a percentage of revenue[6][7].',
